            "review_title": "Review at Karaku Japanese Bbq",
            "review_text": "Son Smith\n1 contribution\n0\nA meal after work with my partner\nMar 2025 • Business\nI think it was an ideal restaurant for a meal after a business meeting. I invited my business partner to have lunch here. I ordered a small Wagyu set and a hotpot set and I'm not even gonna lie, everything was really delicious honestly.\nOh... the space was also beautifully decorated, it felt both formal and luxurious, which was proper for a business lunch. What surprised me the most was that the restaurant even has a parking area for my car tho...super convenient. I think I’ll definitely be back here soon.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nYou guys should ask for recommendation and further!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 9, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
