            "review_title": "Review at Karaku Japanese Bbq",
            "review_text": "Cynthia J. Jones\n2 contributions\n0\nLove the restaurant.\nMar 2025 • Solo\nThis restaurant really worth every penny that I paid. The food impressed me a lot with that original juicy tender Wagyu beef and tongue. The Udon? Gorgeous, I really love that. About the space, it's really spacious and give the chilling cozy vibe of Japan. The waiters and manager are nice and friendly. Love it!\nInsider tip:\nIt'd better to ask for recommendation rather than choosing the menu yourself\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 8, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
