            "review_text": "강민\nBusan, South Korea2 contributions\n1\nIt's solo, grilled meat.\nMar 2025 • Solo\nIt's just another solo trip of mine to Vietnam. Does it sound weird to have a dinner at a Japanese style restaurant in Vietnam XD\nWhat impressed me the most is that they have Wagyu with such a high quality. I order a grilled set with just around 50$. That's crazy, right? \nAnd the taste? absolutely amazing. Although I'm half Korean but I find myself really love the original meat grilled without any spice but with only some soy sauce. \nI would give my thanks to the manager, he help me to choose this combo and he can really communicate with me.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 4, 2025",
