            "review_title": "Review at Karaku Japanese Bbq",
            "review_text": "Ong Jiwoong\nSeoul, South Korea2 contributions\n3\nGive it a go, guys!\nMar 2025 • Couples\nWe all know that 8th March is the most special day for our female beloved one, right?\nMe and my girlfriend were having a trip to Vietnam back then, so I pick this place randomly and make a reservation. \nEverything was nice and the meat quality here really set a standard for the up-coming restaurants that I will visit. \nOne more thing, I ask the manager for any decoration and he gave us a small roses vase and some lights for decoration too.\nI would rate 9 out of 10, but it was the nice waiter makes it to 10/10 XD\nRead more\nInsider tip:\ntry wagyu here\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 28, 2025",
