            "review_text": "Haruitsuki\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n4\n2024 Chrismas night at a Japanese style restaurant in Viet Nam\nDec 2024 • Friends\nIf you're looking for a high-quality Japanese BBQ restaurant in Ho Chi Minh City, especially for special occasions, Karaku Japanese BBQ is a must-try. My family had a fantastic Christmas dinner here.\nWhat impressed me most was the quality of the grilled dishes. We ordered a special set called “Hanabi”. It had variety of meat and a beautiful layout. The beef was incredibly fresh, cut into perfect slices, and seasoned with rich flavors. The Wagyu beef ribs, in particular, were melt-in-your-mouth delicious—a truly wonderful experience. The side dishes, such as kimchi and salad, were also fresh and beautifully presented. Also, the \nThe restaurant's atmosphere is also very cozy and sophisticated, suitable for dates or family gatherings. Since it’s Chrismas, the restaurant was decorated to match with the festival atmosphere. \nReally love this place! 10 out of 10\nRead more\nWritten December 25, 2024",
