            "review_text": "Daniel Nguyen\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam3 contributions\n4\nKaraku Japanese BBQ – The Flavors of Japan in Saigon\nOct 2024 • Couples\nMy partner and I recently tried Karaku Japanese BBQ, and it didn’t disappoint. The cozy Japanese-inspired decor, complete with a koi pond, made for a perfect date night vibe.\nWe ordered a meat set featuring Wagyu beef and Iberico pork, which were fresh and flavorful. Grilling it ourselves over charcoal was fun, and the dipping sauces, especially the sweet-spicy one, really stood out.\nThe staff were super friendly and helpful, guiding us on how to cook the meat just right. The prices, personally, are reasonable. The quality and experience were wonderful overall !\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nIt will be best to have a dinner here since the lights are set up beautifully, creating a cozy space spending time for your beloved one.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 12, 2024",
